#: src/appearance.md:41
msgid ""
"You can also override specific theme attributes for fine-grained control."
msgstr ""

#: src/appearance.md:43
msgid "→ [Themes documentation](./themes.md)"
msgstr ""

#: src/appearance.md:45
msgid "Icon Themes"
msgstr "圖示主題"

#: src/appearance.md:47
msgid ""
"Customize file and folder icons in the Project Panel and tabs. Browse "
"available icon themes with the Icon Theme Selector (`icon theme selector: "
"toggle` in the command palette)."
msgstr ""

